ed_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Specifying `--vmodule` argument does not enable VLOGs. \r\n\r\nHere is the patch which fixes the issue:\r\n```\r\ndiff --git a/src/yb/util/status.cc b/src/yb/util/status.cc\r\nindex 62194e3b04..25af178c82 100644\r\n--- a/src/yb/util/status.cc\r\n+++ b/src/yb/util/status.cc\r\n@@ -81,8 +81,8 @@ struct StatusCategories {\r\n   void Register(const StatusCategoryDescription& description) {\r\n     CHECK(!categories[description.id].name);\r\n-    VLOG(1) << \"Registering status category: \" << static_cast<int>(description.id)\r\n-            << \" (\" << *description.name << \")\";\r\n+//    VLOG(1) << \"Registering status category: \" << static_cast<int>(description.id)\r\n+//            << \" (\" << *description.name << \")\";\r\n     categories[description.id] = description;\r\n   }\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe reason is that GLOG `--vmodule` configuration might break if `VLOG` is used during global variables initialization.","closed_by":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos